  "description": "L1 lighting & atmosphere, final (= l1_r2 + l1_r3 + l1_r4 flattened, plus the round-5 sunset trim: paler key, violet sky ambient, less SSIL orange bounce; and the night lamp trim: lanterns 0.4, fire 0.6, both deeper orange, so pools stay warm on snow). One global pipeline for all tiles: four time-of-day presets (morning / day / sunset / night) with a coloured key + cool fill + hemisphere ambient (cool sky, warm bounce), PCSS soft shadows on an 8k atlas, SSAO reaching lit crevices + light SSIL bounce, a trace of depth haze and a low mist under the ground line that melts the skirt into the backdrop, a studio backdrop (vertical gradient, light pool behind the tile, vignette, contact occlusion, cool/violet cast shadow, stars at night) with robust tonemap compensation, a tilt-shift DOF band that keeps the hero and L叔 sharp, and night = right-side blue moon + compact warm fire/lamp pools + bloom on real emitters only. Only keys by light preset and landscape theme; nothing per tile.",
